  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"Serilum 的模組。充滿愛心製作。為 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 提供大量活躍的模組！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg\" alt=\"關於此模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">《Bottle Your Xp》是一款簡約且可設定的模組，允許你透過<strong>蹲下/按住 Shift 並右鍵點擊</strong>&nbsp;空瓶子，將自己收集的經驗值製作成經驗瓶（附魔藥水瓶）。此功能可選擇性地（在設定檔中設定）對玩家造成傷害，因為該程序可能並非完全無痛。</span></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"依賴項目\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg\" alt=\"收錄於 The Vanilla Experience\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-rpg-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/rpg-bundle.svg\" alt=\"收錄於 Serilum 的 RPG 套組\" width=\"334\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg\" alt=\"環境：伺服器端\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg\" alt=\"可自訂設定\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252fconfiguration-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg\" alt=\"設定指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有可用的設定選項：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"margin-left:10px;padding-left:10px\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>damageOnCreation</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設為 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">啟用後，每次使用者製作經驗瓶時都會受到傷害。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>halfHeartDamageAmount</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設為 1，最小值 1，最大值 20</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">製作經驗瓶時，使用者受到的傷害量（以半顆心為單位）乘以此數值。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>rawXpConsumedOnCreation</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設為 10，最小值 0，最大值 100</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">製作一瓶經驗瓶所需的原始經驗值數量。請謹慎將此值設得太低，否則可能導致經驗值重複複製。</span></p>\n</div>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>實際效果：</strong><br></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/bottle-your-xp/a.webp\" alt=\"使用範例\" width=\"1000\" height=\"556\"></p>\n</div>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"備註與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>只要下載來源仍託管於 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生態系內，您可自由在任何整合包中使用此模組。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 提供所有可用模組的概覽與更多資訊。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">評論功能已關閉，因為我無法在如此多獨立的模組頁面上追蹤評論。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>若有問題、想法、建議或其他事項，請至&nbsp;<a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub 儲存庫</a> 留言。謝謝！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
